---
// /committee: committee interest form for anyone LSP invites to join a
// committee. Built 2026-10-27 for the YTT 2026 cohort (the graduates who
// asked to get more involved), generalized 2026-10-28 (Fez: "broaden who
// can join committees to engage more people"), so the copy no longer
// addresses graduates; the photos still come from graduation night. LSP
// leadership and the Junior Board use the answers to place each person in
// an existing committee. Shared by direct link only (noindex, excluded from
// the sitemap in astro.config.mjs, not in nav/homepage/links), like
// /movecrew and /townhall.
//
// A 5-step wizard inside ONE <form>: About you, Committees, New ideas,
// Commitment, Last things (with a review list). Answers autosave to
// localStorage["lsp_committee_draft"] (24 h) so a phone that drops the tab
// can pick up where it left off.
//
// Submissions POST to a hidden Google Form (same no-cors pattern as
// /waiver and /movecrew): "YTT 2026 Cohort Committee Interest Form", edit id
// 1ewhCmWz9EsvvjYPoFO6qJ_f99agof9OHumOrlOSFBxg (it already had live
// responses when this page was built, 2026-10-27). Endpoint, entry map and
// verbatim options: marketing/committee-form/committee-form.json and the
// GOOGLE FORM CONFIG block in the script below.
//
// Silent-breakage rules (no-cors responses are opaque, so nothing errors):
// - Renaming a question or editing its description is SAFE (entry ids stay).
// - Deleting and recreating a question, or changing an option's text, BREAKS
//   it: the id or the option string no longer matches and Google drops the
//   answer (or the whole response, since the questions are required).
// - Adding a NEW REQUIRED question breaks every submission (the POST lacks
//   it and Google silently drops the response).
// - Switching email collection from "Responder input" to "Verified" breaks
//   every submission (verified needs a signed-in Google session). The page
//   sends the email as the param `emailAddress`.
// - Settings > Responses > "Send responders a copy of their response" MUST
//   stay Off. Always / When requested makes Google attach an invisible
//   reCAPTCHA (the real UI posts a g-recaptcha-response token) and every
//   POST from this page gets a 400 and is dropped. Switched Off 2026-10-27.
// Re-derive ids: curl -sL https://docs.google.com/forms/d/<editId>/viewform
// and parse the FB_PUBLIC_LOAD_DATA_ JSON (question[4][i][0] = entry id).
// Every question except "Comments and/or questions" is required form-side,
// so the page validates all of them before it sends.
//
// IDENTITY: "candlelit rose" from /graduation (restyled 2026-10-27; the first
// build was the plain white studio look and Fez called it "functional but
// looks really boring"). The look and photos are graduation night's; the copy
// is for everyone ("come build with us"). The rules carried over from
// graduation.astro:
//   - Display type is FRAUNCES (loaded globally in Layout.astro). Questions,
//     labels and body stay Rubik.
//   - NO hairline rules and NO gradient bars. Dividers are candle-bokeh dot
//     rows (`.cm-sep`), the progress is a row of five candle dots, and the
//     ornaments are soft glow orbs, cream photo mats and pill shapes.
//   - Gold stays soft: #f0c57c for accents and glows, #d79b47 for CTA fills,
//     checkbox/radio accents and selected options only.
// Layout: deep rose-ink ground; a copy band (pill, headline, one line) and
// BELOW it a full-width hero photo with only a light rose wash, so the cohort
// is clearly seen; a cream form card that overlaps only the floor at the
// bottom of that photo (2.5rem).
// OVERLAY RULE (Fez): text and cards never cover faces. No copy sits on the
// photo at any size, and the card overlaps only the floor. Re-check at 375
// and 1440 if the photo or the hero heights in the style block change.
//
// PHOTOS (all from public/images/graduation/, the 2026-08-07 ceremony; every
// file is under 400 KB, so no resized copies were needed). Never caption or
// alt-text anyone by name.
//   hero     hero.jpg  the 2025 + 2026 cohorts holding their certificates
//   step 1   g02.jpg   arrivals: diploma folder, sunflowers, disco ball
//   step 2   g14.jpg   the crowded group selfie
//   step 3   g03.jpg   two people talking over coffee and a laptop
//   step 4   g06.jpg   guests with hands over their hearts
//   step 5   g09.jpg   the room applauding a hug
//   success  g16.jpg   the whole group together in pink light
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "@/components/Header.astro";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const img = (file) => `${base}images/graduation/${file}`;

// One candid per step, in step order (all landscape 1024x683).
const STEP_PHOTOS = {
    1: { file: "g02.jpg", pos: "50% 50%", alt: "A graduate holds her diploma folder, talking with two friends beside a counter of sunflowers, a disco ball overhead." },
    2: { file: "g14.jpg", pos: "55% 50%", alt: "Graduates and guests pack into a group selfie, everyone leaning in and laughing." },
    3: { file: "g03.jpg", pos: "55% 50%", alt: "Two people talk across a table of iced coffees, a sticker-covered laptop open between them." },
    4: { file: "g06.jpg", pos: "62% 50%", alt: "Guests stand along the studio wall in pink light, hands pressed over their hearts." },
    5: { file: "g09.jpg", pos: "45% 50%", alt: "The room applauds as two graduates embrace, candles glowing along the floor." },
};
const SUCCESS_PHOTO = {
    file: "g16.jpg",
    alt: "The graduating group poses together in warm pink light, gold and white balloons on the floor around them.",
};

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// Committees and their leads (edit names here). `name` is the Google Form
// option string, VERBATIM. A lead of "Vacant" renders as "co-lead seat open".
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
const COMMITTEES = [
    { name: "General Committee", leads: ["Margarita", "Dinorah Zubieta"] },
    { name: "Gala Sub Committee", leads: ["Vanessa Tirado", "Vacant"] },
    { name: "Culture & Ethics", leads: ["Vanessa Tirado", "Yari Jurado"] },
    { name: "Community Impact", leads: ["Lucia"] },
    { name: "Queer Events", leads: ["Mateo", "Kayla"] },
];

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// Option strings: VERBATIM from marketing/committee-form/committee-form.json
// (must match the Google Form character for character: en dashes in "1–2"
// and "3–5", straight apostrophes in the role options).
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
const NOT_INTERESTED = "I am not interested in joining any of the listed committees";
const NEW_COMMITTEE_NONE = "I do not have any new committee suggestions";
const NEW_ROLE_NONE = "I did not suggest a new Committee";
const INVOLVEMENT_OPTIONS = [
    "Occasional involvement: I can contribute when my schedule allows.",
    "Light involvement: I can dedicate 1–2 hours per month.",
    "Moderate involvement: I can dedicate 3–5 hours per month.",
    "Active involvement: I can dedicate 6+ hours per month.",
];
const CONTRIBUTE_OPTIONS = [
    "Attending meetings and planning",
    "Supporting events",
    "Leading projects",
    "Administrative tasks",
    "Creating social media post",
];
const ROLE_OPTIONS = [
    "Leadership: Helping guide the committee's priorities, facilitate meetings, and support decision-making",
    "Project or initiative coordination: Organizing projects, tracking progress, and coordinating tasks",
    "Event planning and support: Helping plan, organize, and facilitate events or activities",
    "Volunteering and task-based support: Helping with specific tasks as needed",
    "Research and resource development: Researching opportunities, gathering information, or developing materials",
    "Communications and outreach: Supporting outreach, sharing updates, and engaging community members",
    "I'm open to taking on different roles depending on the committee's needs",
    "I'm interested in participating but am not ready to take on a leadership or coordination role",
];
// Quick picks for the free-text "Preferred method to contact you?" answer.
const CONTACT_CHIPS = ["Text", "Call", "Email", "WhatsApp", "Instagram DM"];
// Page-side value for an "Other" pick; the script sends it as
// __other_option__ plus the write-in.
const OTHER = "__other__";

const leadsLine = (leads) => {
    const named = leads.filter((l) => l !== "Vacant");
    const open = leads.includes("Vacant");
    return `Led by ${named.join(" & ")}${open ? " · co-lead seat open" : ""}`;
};
// "Head: rest" -> bold head, lighter second line.
const splitLabel = (opt) => {
    const i = opt.indexOf(": ");
    return i > 0 ? { head: opt.slice(0, i), rest: opt.slice(i + 2) } : { head: opt, rest: "" };
};

const CONTACT_EMAIL = "collab@latinasweatproject.com";

// Presentational classes (all defined in the style block below, scoped to
// .cm-page / #cm-*). `hidden` on the error lines is the script's toggle.
const inputClass = "cm-input mt-2 block w-full";
const optionClass = "cm-option";
const checkClass = "cm-check";
const labelClass = "cm-label block";
const legendClass = "cm-label";
const helpClass = "cm-help mt-1";
const fieldErrorClass = "cm-err mt-2 hidden";
const stepHeadingClass = "cm-step-title";
const primaryBtn = "cm-btn cm-btn--gold";
const secondaryBtn = "cm-btn cm-btn--cream";
const textBtn = "cm-textbtn";
---

<Layout
    title="Committee interest | The Latina Sweat Project"
    description="Join an LSP committee: tell LSP leadership and the Junior Board where you'd fit, and they'll place you."
    robots="noindex, nofollow"
    socialImage="images/committee/committee-og.jpg"
    socialImageAlt="Join a committee: the LSP community gathered in two rows at the studio in Pilsen, many holding framed certificates."
    socialImageWidth={1200}
    socialImageHeight={630}
    socialImageType="image/jpeg"
>
    <Header />
    <main class="cm-page min-h-screen overflow-x-clip font-sans">
        {/* ============================== HERO ============================== */}
        <section class="cm-hero" aria-labelledby="cm-title">
            {/* Candle bokeh in the ink band above the photo (never on the people). */}
            <div class="cm-candles" aria-hidden="true">
                <span style="--x: 7%; --y: 10%; --s: 13px; --o: 0.5;"></span>
                <span style="--x: 22%; --y: 26%; --s: 8px; --o: 0.32;"></span>
                <span style="--x: 74%; --y: 8%; --s: 10px; --o: 0.36;"></span>
                <span style="--x: 90%; --y: 22%; --s: 15px; --o: 0.42;"></span>
                <span style="--x: 58%; --y: 30%; --s: 7px; --o: 0.26;"></span>
            </div>

            <div class="cm-hero-copy">
                <p class="cm-pill">Get involved</p>
                <h1 id="cm-title" class="cm-hero-title">Join a <em>committee</em></h1>
                <p class="cm-hero-lede">
                    Come build with us: tell us where you'd fit, and we'll
                    place you on a committee.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="cm-hero-photo">
                <img
                    src={img("hero.jpg")}
                    width="1024"
                    height="683"
                    alt="The 2025 and 2026 cohorts pose in two rows across the studio, nearly everyone holding a framed certificate."
                    fetchpriority="high"
                    decoding="async"
                />
            </div>
        </section>

        {/* ============================== FORM ============================== */}
        <section class="cm-form-section">
            <div class="cm-orb cm-orb--rose" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="cm-orb cm-orb--gold" aria-hidden="true"></div>

            <div class="cm-shell">
                <div id="cm-card" class="cm-card">
                    {/* Draft banner: shown by the script when a saved draft is restored. */}
                    <div id="cm-draft" hidden role="status" class="cm-draft">
                        <p class="cm-draft-text">
                            We saved your answers from <span id="cm-draft-when">a moment ago</span>.
                        </p>
                        <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                            <button id="cm-draft-resume" type="button" class:list={[primaryBtn, "cm-btn--small"]}>
                                Pick up where I left off
                            </button>
                            <button id="cm-draft-reset" type="button" class:list={[secondaryBtn, "cm-btn--small"]}>
                                Start over
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <form id="cm-form" class="relative" novalidate>
                        <!-- Honeypot: off-screen field humans never see or fill.
                             Bots that auto-fill every input trip it and get a
                             silent "success" with nothing sent to the form. -->
                        <div class="absolute -left-[9999px] top-auto h-px w-px overflow-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
                            <label for="cm-website">Website</label>
                            <input id="cm-website" name="website" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
                        </div>

                        {/* Progress: sticks under the fixed site header (top set by the script).
                            The five candle dots live INSIDE the progressbar element and are
                            driven purely by CSS from the aria-valuenow the script writes, so
                            the script is unchanged. #cm-bar is kept (the script still sets its
                            width) but is visually hidden: no gradient bars on this page. */}
                        <div id="cm-progress" class="cm-progress sticky z-30">
                            <div class="cm-progress-row">
                                <div
                                    id="cm-progressbar"
                                    role="progressbar"
                                    aria-label="Form progress"
                                    aria-valuemin="1"
                                    aria-valuemax="5"
                                    aria-valuenow="1"
                                    aria-valuetext="Step 1 of 5: About you"
                                    class="cm-dots"
                                >
                                    <span class="cm-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                    <span class="cm-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                    <span class="cm-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                    <span class="cm-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                    <span class="cm-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                    <div id="cm-bar" class="cm-bar" style="width: 20%"></div>
                                </div>
                                <p id="cm-progress-label" class="cm-progress-label">
                                    Step 1 of 5 · About 2 minutes left
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="mt-5">
                            {/* ======================= STEP 1: ABOUT YOU ======================= */}
                            <fieldset data-step="1" data-title="About you" aria-labelledby="cm-h-1" class="cm-step min-w-0 space-y-6">
                                <div class="cm-step-head">
                                    <figure class="cm-mat">
                                        <img src={img(STEP_PHOTOS[1].file)} width="1024" height="683" alt={STEP_PHOTOS[1].alt} loading="lazy" decoding="async" style={`object-position: ${STEP_PHOTOS[1].pos}`} />
                                    </figure>
                                    <div>
                                        <h2 id="cm-h-1" tabindex="-1" class={stepHeadingClass}>About you</h2>
                                        <p class={helpClass}>Every question is required unless it says optional.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div>
                                    <label for="cm-name" class={labelClass}>Full name</label>
                                    <input id="cm-name" name="fullName" type="text" autocomplete="name" autocapitalize="words" class={inputClass} aria-describedby="cm-name-err" />
                                    <p id="cm-name-err" class={fieldErrorClass}>Please add your full name.</p>
                                </div>

                                <div>
                                    <label for="cm-email" class={labelClass}>Email</label>
                                    <input id="cm-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" class={inputClass} aria-describedby="cm-email-err" />
                                    <p id="cm-email-err" class={fieldErrorClass}>Please add a valid email address.</p>
                                </div>

                                <div>
                                    <label for="cm-phone" class={labelClass}>Phone number</label>
                                    <input id="cm-phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel" class={inputClass} aria-describedby="cm-phone-err" />
                                    <p id="cm-phone-err" class={fieldErrorClass}>Please add a phone number we can reach you at.</p>
                                </div>

                                <div class="cm-sep" aria-hidden="true"></div>

                                <div>
                                    <label for="cm-contact" class={labelClass}>Best way to reach you</label>
                                    <p id="cm-contact-help" class={helpClass}>Tap one or type your own.</p>
                                    <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2" role="group" aria-label="Quick picks">
                                        {CONTACT_CHIPS.map((chip) => (
                                            <button type="button" data-chip={chip} aria-pressed="false" class="cm-chip">
                                                {chip}
                                            </button>
                                        ))}
                                    </div>
                                    <input id="cm-contact" name="contactMethod" type="text" class={inputClass} aria-describedby="cm-contact-help cm-contact-err" />
                                    <p id="cm-contact-err" class={fieldErrorClass}>Please tell us the best way to reach you.</p>
                                </div>
                            </fieldset>

                            {/* ======================= STEP 2: COMMITTEES ======================= */}
                            <fieldset data-step="2" data-title="Committees" aria-labelledby="cm-h-2" class="cm-step min-w-0 space-y-8" hidden>
                                <div class="cm-step-head">
                                    <figure class="cm-mat">
                                        <img src={img(STEP_PHOTOS[2].file)} width="1024" height="683" alt={STEP_PHOTOS[2].alt} loading="lazy" decoding="async" style={`object-position: ${STEP_PHOTOS[2].pos}`} />
                                    </figure>
                                    <div>
                                        <h2 id="cm-h-2" tabindex="-1" class={stepHeadingClass}>Committees</h2>
                                        <p class={helpClass}>Where you'd like to plug in.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <fieldset class="min-w-0" aria-describedby="cm-committees-err">
                                    <legend class={legendClass}>Which committees interest you?</legend>
                                    <p class={helpClass}>Pick all that apply.</p>
                                    <div class="mt-3 space-y-2">
                                        {COMMITTEES.map((c) => (
                                            <label class={optionClass}>
                                                <input type="checkbox" name="committees" value={c.name} class={checkClass} />
                                                <span class="min-w-0">
                                                    <span class="cm-opt-head">{c.name}</span>
                                                    <span class="cm-opt-sub">{leadsLine(c.leads)}</span>
                                                </span>
                                            </label>
                                        ))}
                                        <label class={optionClass}>
                                            <input type="checkbox" name="committees" value={NOT_INTERESTED} data-exclusive="1" class={checkClass} />
                                            <span class="min-w-0">{NOT_INTERESTED}</span>
                                        </label>
                                    </div>
                                    <p id="cm-committees-err" class={fieldErrorClass}>Please pick at least one.</p>
                                </fieldset>

                                <div class="cm-sep" aria-hidden="true"></div>

                                <div>
                                    <label for="cm-skills" class={labelClass}>Skills you'd like to offer LSP</label>
                                    <p id="cm-skills-help" class={helpClass}>For example: event setup, photography, translation, design.</p>
                                    <input id="cm-skills" name="skills" type="text" class={inputClass} aria-describedby="cm-skills-help cm-skills-err" />
                                    <p id="cm-skills-err" class={fieldErrorClass}>Please share at least one skill.</p>
                                </div>
                            </fieldset>

                            {/* ======================= STEP 3: NEW IDEAS ======================= */}
                            <fieldset data-step="3" data-title="New ideas" aria-labelledby="cm-h-3" class="cm-step min-w-0 space-y-8" hidden>
                                <div class="cm-step-head">
                                    <figure class="cm-mat">
                                        <img src={img(STEP_PHOTOS[3].file)} width="1024" height="683" alt={STEP_PHOTOS[3].alt} loading="lazy" decoding="async" style={`object-position: ${STEP_PHOTOS[3].pos}`} />
                                    </figure>
                                    <div>
                                        <h2 id="cm-h-3" tabindex="-1" class={stepHeadingClass}>New ideas</h2>
                                        <p class={helpClass}>Anything you'd love LSP to start.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <fieldset class="min-w-0" aria-describedby="cm-newc-err">
                                    <legend class={legendClass}>Is there a committee you'd like LSP to start?</legend>
                                    <div class="mt-3 space-y-2">
                                        <label class={optionClass}>
                                            <input type="radio" name="newCommitteeChoice" value="none" class={checkClass} />
                                            <span class="min-w-0">No new suggestions</span>
                                        </label>
                                        <label class={optionClass}>
                                            <input type="radio" name="newCommitteeChoice" value="idea" class={checkClass} />
                                            <span class="min-w-0">I have an idea</span>
                                        </label>
                                    </div>
                                    <p id="cm-newc-err" class={fieldErrorClass}>Please pick one.</p>
                                    <div id="cm-newc-text-wrap" class="mt-4" hidden>
                                        <label for="cm-newc-text" class={labelClass}>What's the committee?</label>
                                        <input id="cm-newc-text" name="newCommitteeText" type="text" class={inputClass} aria-describedby="cm-newc-text-err" />
                                        <p id="cm-newc-text-err" class={fieldErrorClass}>Please tell us your committee idea.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </fieldset>

                                {/* Hidden by CSS (:has) while the role question below is hidden. */}
                                <div class="cm-sep cm-sep--newrole" aria-hidden="true"></div>

                                <fieldset id="cm-newrole-wrap" class="min-w-0" aria-describedby="cm-newrole-err" hidden>
                                    <legend class={legendClass}>What role would you take in it?</legend>
                                    <div class="mt-3 space-y-2">
                                        <label class={optionClass}>
                                            <input type="radio" name="newRoleChoice" value="none" class={checkClass} />
                                            <span class="min-w-0">I'd rather not say</span>
                                        </label>
                                        <label class={optionClass}>
                                            <input type="radio" name="newRoleChoice" value="idea" class={checkClass} />
                                            <span class="min-w-0">I know the role I'd take</span>
                                        </label>
                                    </div>
                                    <p id="cm-newrole-err" class={fieldErrorClass}>Please pick one.</p>
                                    <div id="cm-newrole-text-wrap" class="mt-4" hidden>
                                        <label for="cm-newrole-text" class={labelClass}>Your role</label>
                                        <input id="cm-newrole-text" name="newRoleText" type="text" class={inputClass} aria-describedby="cm-newrole-text-err" />
                                        <p id="cm-newrole-text-err" class={fieldErrorClass}>Please describe the role you'd take.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </fieldset>
                            </fieldset>

                            {/* ======================= STEP 4: COMMITMENT ======================= */}
                            <fieldset data-step="4" data-title="Commitment" aria-labelledby="cm-h-4" class="cm-step min-w-0 space-y-8" hidden>
                                <div class="cm-step-head">
                                    <figure class="cm-mat">
                                        <img src={img(STEP_PHOTOS[4].file)} width="1024" height="683" alt={STEP_PHOTOS[4].alt} loading="lazy" decoding="async" style={`object-position: ${STEP_PHOTOS[4].pos}`} />
                                    </figure>
                                    <div>
                                        <h2 id="cm-h-4" tabindex="-1" class={stepHeadingClass}>Commitment</h2>
                                        <p class={helpClass}>What fits your life right now.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <fieldset class="min-w-0" aria-describedby="cm-inv-err">
                                    <legend class={legendClass}>How much time can you realistically give?</legend>
                                    <div class="mt-3 space-y-2">
                                        {INVOLVEMENT_OPTIONS.map((opt) => {
                                            const { head, rest } = splitLabel(opt);
                                            return (
                                                <label class={optionClass}>
                                                    <input type="radio" name="involvement" value={opt} class={checkClass} />
                                                    <span class="min-w-0">
                                                        <span class="cm-opt-head">{head}</span>
                                                        {rest && <span class="cm-opt-sub">{rest}</span>}
                                                    </span>
                                                </label>
                                            );
                                        })}
                                        <label class={optionClass}>
                                            <input type="radio" name="involvement" value={OTHER} class={checkClass} />
                                            <span class="cm-opt-head min-w-0">Other</span>
                                        </label>
                                    </div>
                                    <p id="cm-inv-err" class={fieldErrorClass}>Please pick one.</p>
                                    <div id="cm-inv-other-wrap" class="mt-4" hidden>
                                        <label for="cm-inv-other" class={labelClass}>Your answer</label>
                                        <input id="cm-inv-other" name="involvementOther" type="text" class={inputClass} aria-describedby="cm-inv-other-err" />
                                        <p id="cm-inv-other-err" class={fieldErrorClass}>Please describe the time you can give.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </fieldset>

                                <div class="cm-sep" aria-hidden="true"></div>

                                <fieldset class="min-w-0" aria-describedby="cm-con-err">
                                    <legend class={legendClass}>How do you want to contribute?</legend>
                                    <p class={helpClass}>Pick one.</p>
                                    <div class="mt-3 space-y-2">
                                        {CONTRIBUTE_OPTIONS.map((opt) => (
                                            <label class={optionClass}>
                                                <input type="radio" name="contribute" value={opt} class={checkClass} />
                                                <span class="cm-opt-head min-w-0">{opt}</span>
                                            </label>
                                        ))}
                                        <label class={optionClass}>
                                            <input type="radio" name="contribute" value={OTHER} class={checkClass} />
                                            <span class="cm-opt-head min-w-0">Other</span>
                                        </label>
                                    </div>
                                    <p id="cm-con-err" class={fieldErrorClass}>Please pick one.</p>
                                    <div id="cm-con-other-wrap" class="mt-4" hidden>
                                        <label for="cm-con-other" class={labelClass}>Your answer</label>
                                        <input id="cm-con-other" name="contributeOther" type="text" class={inputClass} aria-describedby="cm-con-other-err" />
                                        <p id="cm-con-other-err" class={fieldErrorClass}>Please describe how you'd contribute.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </fieldset>

                                <div class="cm-sep" aria-hidden="true"></div>

                                <fieldset class="min-w-0" aria-describedby="cm-roles-err">
                                    <legend class={legendClass}>What roles would you feel comfortable taking on?</legend>
                                    <p class={helpClass}>Pick all that apply.</p>
                                    <div class="mt-3 space-y-2">
                                        {ROLE_OPTIONS.map((opt) => {
                                            const { head, rest } = splitLabel(opt);
                                            return (
                                                <label class={optionClass}>
                                                    <input type="checkbox" name="roles" value={opt} class={checkClass} />
                                                    <span class="min-w-0">
                                                        <span class:list={["block", rest ? "cm-opt-head" : ""]}>{head}</span>
                                                        {rest && <span class="cm-opt-sub">{rest}</span>}
                                                    </span>
                                                </label>
                                            );
                                        })}
                                        <label class={optionClass}>
                                            <input type="checkbox" name="roles" value={OTHER} class={checkClass} />
                                            <span class="cm-opt-head min-w-0">Other</span>
                                        </label>
                                    </div>
                                    <p id="cm-roles-err" class={fieldErrorClass}>Please pick at least one.</p>
                                    <div id="cm-roles-other-wrap" class="mt-4" hidden>
                                        <label for="cm-roles-other" class={labelClass}>Your answer</label>
                                        <input id="cm-roles-other" name="rolesOther" type="text" class={inputClass} aria-describedby="cm-roles-other-err" />
                                        <p id="cm-roles-other-err" class={fieldErrorClass}>Please describe the role.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </fieldset>
                            </fieldset>

                            {/* ======================= STEP 5: LAST THINGS ======================= */}
                            <fieldset data-step="5" data-title="Last things" aria-labelledby="cm-h-5" class="cm-step min-w-0 space-y-8" hidden>
                                <div class="cm-step-head">
                                    <figure class="cm-mat">
                                        <img src={img(STEP_PHOTOS[5].file)} width="1024" height="683" alt={STEP_PHOTOS[5].alt} loading="lazy" decoding="async" style={`object-position: ${STEP_PHOTOS[5].pos}`} />
                                    </figure>
                                    <div>
                                        <h2 id="cm-h-5" tabindex="-1" class={stepHeadingClass}>Last things</h2>
                                        <p class={helpClass}>Almost done. Check your answers, then send.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div>
                                    <label for="cm-dates" class={labelClass}>Important dates you aren't available</label>
                                    <p id="cm-dates-help" class={helpClass}>Trips, busy seasons, standing commitments. If none, write "None".</p>
                                    <textarea id="cm-dates" name="unavailableDates" rows="3" class={inputClass} aria-describedby="cm-dates-help cm-dates-err"></textarea>
                                    <p id="cm-dates-err" class={fieldErrorClass}>Please add your dates, or write "None".</p>
                                </div>

                                <div>
                                    <label for="cm-comments" class={labelClass}>Comments or questions</label>
                                    <p class={helpClass}>Optional.</p>
                                    <textarea id="cm-comments" name="comments" rows="3" class={inputClass}></textarea>
                                </div>

                                <div class="cm-sep" aria-hidden="true"></div>

                                <div>
                                    <h3 class="cm-review-title">Review your answers</h3>
                                    <div id="cm-review" class="cm-review mt-3"></div>
                                </div>
                            </fieldset>
                        </div>

                        <p id="cm-error" role="alert" class="mt-6 hidden rounded-2xl bg-red-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-red-700"></p>

                        {/* Wizard footer */}
                        <div class="mt-10">
                            <div class="cm-sep mb-7" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                                <button id="cm-back" type="button" class:list={[secondaryBtn, "shrink-0"]} hidden>Back</button>
                                <button id="cm-next" type="button" class:list={[primaryBtn, "ml-auto flex-1 sm:flex-none sm:min-w-[9rem]"]}>Next</button>
                                <button id="cm-submit" type="submit" class:list={[primaryBtn, "ml-auto flex-1 sm:flex-none"]} hidden>Send my answers</button>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mt-5">
                                <button id="cm-restart" type="button" class={textBtn} hidden>Restart form</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>

                {/* Success state */}
                <div id="cm-success" class="cm-card cm-success" tabindex="-1" hidden>
                    <div class="cm-success-orb" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                    <figure class="cm-mat cm-mat--wide">
                        <img src={img(SUCCESS_PHOTO.file)} width="1024" height="683" alt={SUCCESS_PHOTO.alt} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                    </figure>
                    <h2 class="cm-success-title">You're in the loop</h2>
                    <p class="cm-success-lede">
                        Thanks<span id="cm-success-name"></span>. LSP leadership and
                        the Junior Board use these answers to place you in a
                        committee.
                    </p>
                    <p class="cm-success-body">
                        They'll reach out by your preferred method<span id="cm-success-method"></span>.
                    </p>
                    <div class="cm-sep cm-sep--left mt-8" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                    <button id="cm-another" type="button" class:list={[textBtn, "mt-6"]}>Submit another response</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        {/* ========================== SMALL PRINT ========================== */}
        <section class="cm-smallprint">
            <div class="cm-sep cm-sep--ink" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <p>
                Questions?{" "}
                <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`} class="cm-mail">{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>
            </p>
        </section>
    </main>
</Layout>

<style is:global>
    /* Global so the review list the script builds is covered too. Every
       selector is scoped under .cm-page or a #cm-* id. Tailwind v4 utilities
       sit in a cascade layer, so these unlayered rules win where they
       overlap: keep margins/display out of the component classes. */

    /* ------------------------------------------------------------------
       CANDLELIT ROSE tokens (from /graduation), plus a cream card ink.
    ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
    .cm-page {
        --ink: #1e1216;
        --ink-raised: #2b1520;
        --paper: #f6efe3;
        --paper-soft: rgba(246, 239, 227, 0.78);
        --paper-faint: rgba(246, 239, 227, 0.5);
        --gold: #d79b47;
        --gold-light: #f0c57c;
        --rose: #e08cb8;
        --card: #fbf5ec;
        --card-raised: #fffcf7;
        --card-ink: #2a1820;
        --card-muted: #75606a;
        --rose-ink: #96376a;
        --line-soft: rgba(42, 24, 32, 0.12);

        position: relative;
        isolation: isolate;
        background:
            radial-gradient(60rem 36rem at 12% 4%, rgba(224, 140, 184, 0.16), transparent 70%),
            radial-gradient(50rem 34rem at 92% 40%, rgba(224, 140, 184, 0.1), transparent 72%),
            radial-gradient(56rem 36rem at 50% 104%, rgba(240, 197, 124, 0.09), transparent 70%),
            linear-gradient(176deg, var(--ink-raised) 0%, var(--ink) 40%, var(--ink) 100%);
        color: var(--paper);
        font-family: "Rubik", sans-serif;
    }
    /* Sticky fix, this page only. Layout.astro puts overflow-x: hidden on
       BOTH <html> and <body>; that turns <body> into a (non-scrolling)
       scroll container, so `position: sticky` inside it never sticks.
       `clip` still stops horizontal scroll but is not a scroll container.
       Browsers without `clip` ignore this and keep `hidden`. */
    html:has(.cm-page),
    html:has(.cm-page) body {
        overflow-x: clip;
    }
    /* Component classes set display, which would otherwise beat the hidden
       attribute the script toggles. */
    .cm-page [hidden] {
        display: none !important;
    }

    /* ------------------------------ Hero ------------------------------ */
    /* STACKED at every size: the copy band sits on the ink ground, then the
       photo starts BELOW it, so no text ever lands on the photo. The wash is
       light (faint rose veil + a short top fade) so the cohort is clearly
       seen; the card overlaps only the floor band at the bottom.
       Phones: 4:3 at full width (min 14.5rem), object-position 50% 62%.
       768+: a capped band, cropped from the ceiling so heads sit ~20-25%
       down and the floor stays below the feet for the card's 2.5rem overlap.
       If you change these heights, re-check the people at 375 and 1440. */
    .cm-hero {
        position: relative;
        isolation: isolate;
        padding-top: clamp(2.25rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
        text-align: center;
    }
    .cm-candles {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0 0 auto 0;
        height: clamp(14rem, 34vw, 22rem);
        z-index: 2;
        pointer-events: none;
    }
    .cm-candles span {
        position: absolute;
        left: var(--x);
        top: var(--y);
        width: var(--s);
        height: var(--s);
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(240, 197, 124, 0.95), rgba(215, 155, 71, 0.28) 55%, transparent 72%);
        opacity: var(--o);
        filter: blur(5px);
    }
    .cm-hero-copy {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 3;
        max-width: 40rem;
        margin-inline: auto;
        padding-inline: 1rem;
    }
    .cm-pill {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: var(--paper);
        padding: 0.4rem 0.95rem;
        color: var(--rose-ink);
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        line-height: 1.2;
        box-shadow: 0 0 1.6rem rgba(240, 197, 124, 0.25);
    }
    .cm-hero-title {
        margin-top: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--paper);
        font-family: "Fraunces", Georgia, serif;
        font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 10vw, 4.6rem);
        font-weight: 560;
        letter-spacing: -0.012em;
        line-height: 1.04;
        text-shadow: 0 2px 22px rgba(30, 18, 22, 0.55);
    }
    .cm-hero-title em {
        color: var(--gold-light);
        font-style: italic;
        font-weight: 450;
    }
    .cm-hero-lede {
        max-width: 30rem;
        margin: 0.9rem auto 0;
        color: var(--paper-soft);
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        text-shadow: 0 1px 14px rgba(30, 18, 22, 0.7);
    }
    .cm-hero-photo {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
        min-height: 14.5rem;
        margin-top: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2rem);
        margin-inline: auto;
        max-width: 96rem;
        overflow: hidden;
        /* Fade the photo itself so it melts into the page gradient with no
           seam: a short fade at the top, ~12% at the bottom into the card. */
        -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, #000 9%, #000 88%, transparent 100%);
        mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, #000 9%, #000 88%, transparent 100%);
    }
    .cm-hero-photo img {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
        object-position: 50% 62%;
    }
    /* The rose wash, kept light: a faint rose veil over the whole shot and a
       short ink fade (max 0.4) over the top 18%. Fully clear below that. */
    .cm-hero-photo::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background:
            linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(30, 18, 22, 0.4) 0%, rgba(30, 18, 22, 0.16) 10%, transparent 18%),
            linear-gradient(rgba(224, 140, 184, 0.14), rgba(224, 140, 184, 0.14));
        pointer-events: none;
    }
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .cm-hero-photo {
            aspect-ratio: auto;
            height: clamp(20rem, 42vw, 34rem);
        }
        .cm-hero-photo img {
            object-position: 50% 73%;
        }
    }
    /* Wide screens: the photo stops at 96rem and its sides melt away too. */
    @media (min-width: 1280px) {
        .cm-hero-photo {
            -webkit-mask-image:
                linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, #000 9%, #000 88%, transparent 100%),
                linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, #000 9%, #000 91%, transparent 100%);
            -webkit-mask-composite: source-in;
            mask-image:
                linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, #000 9%, #000 88%, transparent 100%),
                linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, #000 9%, #000 91%, transparent 100%);
            mask-composite: intersect;
        }
    }

    /* ---------------------------- Form card ---------------------------- */
    /* Pulled up 2.5rem over the floor band at the bottom of the hero photo
       only (never the people). */
    .cm-form-section {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        margin-top: -2.5rem;
        padding: 0 1rem clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 5.5rem);
    }
    .cm-orb {
        position: absolute;
        z-index: 0;
        border-radius: 50%;
        filter: blur(60px);
        pointer-events: none;
    }
    .cm-orb--rose {
        top: 4rem;
        left: max(-8rem, calc(50% - 34rem));
        width: 22rem;
        height: 22rem;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(224, 140, 184, 0.3), transparent 70%);
    }
    .cm-orb--gold {
        bottom: 8rem;
        right: max(-8rem, calc(50% - 34rem));
        width: 20rem;
        height: 20rem;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(240, 197, 124, 0.2), transparent 70%);
    }
    .cm-shell {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        max-width: 42rem;
        margin-inline: auto;
    }
    .cm-card {
        --cm-pad: 1.25rem;
        position: relative;
        border-radius: 1.75rem;
        background: var(--card);
        padding: 1.5rem var(--cm-pad) var(--cm-pad);
        color: var(--card-ink);
        box-shadow:
            0 1.6rem 3.6rem rgba(10, 4, 7, 0.45),
            0 0 4rem rgba(224, 140, 184, 0.12);
    }
    @media (min-width: 640px) {
        .cm-card {
            --cm-pad: 2.25rem;
            padding-top: 1.75rem;
        }
    }

    /* Sticky progress sits under the fixed site header; --cm-top is the
       header's measured height (the script keeps it in sync). */
    .cm-progress {
        top: var(--cm-top, 7rem);
        margin-inline: calc(-1 * var(--cm-pad));
        padding: 0.85rem var(--cm-pad) 0.85rem;
        background: var(--card);
    }
    /* Soft fade under the bar: invisible at rest (cream on cream), it eases
       the content out as it scrolls beneath the stuck bar. */
    .cm-progress::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        top: 100%;
        height: 0.9rem;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--card), rgba(251, 245, 236, 0));
        pointer-events: none;
    }
    .cm-progress-row {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 0.5rem 1rem;
    }
    .cm-progress-label {
        color: var(--card-muted);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 600;
    }
    .cm-dots {
        position: relative;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.85rem;
        height: 1.25rem;
    }
    .cm-dot {
        display: block;
        width: 0.7rem;
        height: 0.7rem;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: rgba(42, 24, 32, 0.13);
        transition:
            background-color 300ms ease,
            box-shadow 300ms ease,
            transform 300ms ease;
    }
    /* Kept for the script (it sets the width); never drawn. */
    .cm-bar {
        position: absolute;
        width: 0;
        height: 0;
        overflow: hidden;
        opacity: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
    }
    /* Done dots: soft gold glow. */
    #cm-progressbar[aria-valuenow="2"] .cm-dot:nth-child(-n + 1),
    #cm-progressbar[aria-valuenow="3"] .cm-dot:nth-child(-n + 2),
    #cm-progressbar[aria-valuenow="4"] .cm-dot:nth-child(-n + 3),
    #cm-progressbar[aria-valuenow="5"] .cm-dot:nth-child(-n + 4) {
        background: var(--gold-light);
        box-shadow: 0 0 0.6rem rgba(240, 197, 124, 0.85);
    }
    /* Current dot: candle gold, a touch bigger, with a slow pulse. */
    #cm-progressbar[aria-valuenow="1"] .cm-dot:nth-child(1),
    #cm-progressbar[aria-valuenow="2"] .cm-dot:nth-child(2),
    #cm-progressbar[aria-valuenow="3"] .cm-dot:nth-child(3),
    #cm-progressbar[aria-valuenow="4"] .cm-dot:nth-child(4),
    #cm-progressbar[aria-valuenow="5"] .cm-dot:nth-child(5) {
        background: var(--gold);
        transform: scale(1.35);
        box-shadow: 0 0 0.7rem rgba(215, 155, 71, 0.75);
        animation: cm-candle 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes cm-candle {
        0%,
        100% {
            box-shadow: 0 0 0.55rem rgba(215, 155, 71, 0.6);
        }
        50% {
            box-shadow:
                0 0 1.1rem rgba(240, 197, 124, 0.95),
                0 0 0.3rem rgba(215, 155, 71, 0.9);
        }
    }

    #cm-form {
        scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--cm-top, 7rem) + 0.5rem);
    }
    /* Keep focused fields clear of the header + sticky progress. */
    #cm-form :is(input, textarea, button, h2) {
        scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--cm-top, 7rem) + 6.5rem);
    }

    /* ------------------------- Draft banner ------------------------- */
    .cm-draft {
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        border-radius: 1.25rem;
        background: rgba(224, 140, 184, 0.14);
        padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
    }
    .cm-draft-text {
        color: var(--rose-ink);
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* ---------------------- Step head + photo mats ---------------------- */
    .cm-step-head {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1.1rem;
    }
    @media (min-width: 640px) {
        .cm-step-head {
            grid-template-columns: 11.5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }
    }
    .cm-mat {
        margin: 0;
        border-radius: 1.25rem;
        background: var(--card-raised);
        padding: 0.45rem;
        box-shadow:
            0 0.9rem 2rem rgba(43, 21, 32, 0.16),
            0 0 1.6rem rgba(240, 197, 124, 0.16);
    }
    .cm-mat img {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
        object-fit: cover;
        border-radius: 0.9rem;
        background: rgba(224, 140, 184, 0.2);
    }
    .cm-mat--wide img {
        aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;
    }
    .cm-step-title {
        color: var(--card-ink);
        font-family: "Fraunces", Georgia, serif;
        font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 6vw, 2.35rem);
        font-weight: 560;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        line-height: 1.08;
    }
    .cm-step-title:focus {
        outline: none;
    }

    /* --------------------------- Questions --------------------------- */
    .cm-label {
        color: var(--card-ink);
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        line-height: 1.4;
    }
    .cm-help {
        color: var(--card-muted);
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .cm-err {
        color: #b42318;
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        font-weight: 600;
    }
    .cm-input {
        border: 1.5px solid rgba(42, 24, 32, 0.14);
        border-radius: 0.95rem;
        background: var(--card-raised);
        padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
        color: var(--card-ink);
        font-size: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.5;
        transition:
            border-color 160ms ease,
            box-shadow 160ms ease;
    }
    .cm-input::placeholder {
        color: rgba(42, 24, 32, 0.4);
    }
    .cm-input:focus {
        border-color: var(--gold);
        outline: none;
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(240, 197, 124, 0.42);
    }
    .cm-input[aria-invalid="true"] {
        border-color: #c4382d;
    }
    textarea.cm-input {
        resize: vertical;
    }

    /* Option rows: cream, rounded, full width; soft gold when picked. */
    .cm-option {
        display: flex;
        width: 100%;
        cursor: pointer;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 0.8rem;
        border: 1.5px solid rgba(42, 24, 32, 0.09);
        border-radius: 1.1rem;
        background: var(--card-raised);
        padding: 0.95rem 1.05rem;
        color: var(--card-ink);
        line-height: 1.45;
        transition:
            border-color 160ms ease,
            background-color 160ms ease,
            box-shadow 160ms ease;
    }
    .cm-option:hover {
        border-color: rgba(215, 155, 71, 0.5);
    }
    .cm-option:has(:checked) {
        border-color: rgba(215, 155, 71, 0.9);
        background: #fbeed6;
        box-shadow: 0 0 1.2rem rgba(240, 197, 124, 0.3);
    }
    .cm-option:has(:focus-visible) {
        outline: 3px solid rgba(215, 155, 71, 0.6);
        outline-offset: 2px;
    }
    .cm-check {
        flex-shrink: 0;
        width: 1.1rem;
        height: 1.1rem;
        margin-top: 0.15rem;
        accent-color: var(--gold);
    }
    .cm-opt-head {
        display: block;
        font-weight: 600;
    }
    .cm-opt-sub {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 0.15rem;
        color: var(--card-muted);
        font-size: 0.875rem;
    }

    /* Contact quick picks: cream pills, gold when picked. */
    .cm-chip {
        border: 1.5px solid rgba(42, 24, 32, 0.14);
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: var(--card-raised);
        padding: 0.45rem 1rem;
        color: var(--card-ink);
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        transition:
            border-color 160ms ease,
            background-color 160ms ease,
            box-shadow 160ms ease;
    }
    .cm-chip:hover {
        border-color: var(--gold);
    }
    .cm-chip[aria-pressed="true"] {
        border-color: var(--gold);
        background: var(--gold-light);
        color: #24141a;
        box-shadow: 0 0 1rem rgba(240, 197, 124, 0.45);
    }
    .cm-chip:focus-visible {
        outline: 3px solid rgba(215, 155, 71, 0.6);
        outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    /* ------------------- Candle-bokeh dot row divider ------------------- */
    /* The graduation `.sep`, tuned for cream: same dots, a warmer glow. */
    .cm-sep {
        width: 122px;
        height: 12px;
        margin-inline: auto;
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        background-image:
            radial-gradient(circle 2.5px at 6px 6px, #f0c57c 0 58%, transparent 70%),
            radial-gradient(circle 3.5px at 30px 6px, #e08cb8 0 56%, transparent 70%),
            radial-gradient(circle 5px at 60px 6px, #f0c57c 0 56%, transparent 70%),
            radial-gradient(circle 3.5px at 90px 6px, #e08cb8 0 56%, transparent 70%),
            radial-gradient(circle 2.5px at 114px 6px, #f0c57c 0 58%, transparent 70%);
        filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(215, 155, 71, 0.45));
    }
    .cm-sep--left {
        margin-inline: 0;
    }
    .cm-sep--ink {
        filter: drop-shadow(0 0 7px rgba(240, 197, 124, 0.5));
    }
    /* No divider before the role question while it is hidden. */
    .cm-sep--newrole:has(+ #cm-newrole-wrap[hidden]) {
        display: none;
    }

    /* ---------------------------- Buttons ---------------------------- */
    .cm-btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 0.9rem 1.75rem;
        font-family: "Rubik", sans-serif;
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1.2;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition:
            transform 180ms ease,
            background-color 180ms ease,
            border-color 180ms ease,
            box-shadow 180ms ease;
    }
    .cm-btn--gold {
        background: var(--gold);
        color: #24141a;
        box-shadow: 0 0.7rem 1.6rem rgba(215, 155, 71, 0.3);
    }
    .cm-btn--gold:hover {
        background: #e0a957;
        transform: translateY(-1px);
        box-shadow: 0 0.9rem 2rem rgba(215, 155, 71, 0.38);
    }
    .cm-btn--cream {
        border: 1.5px solid rgba(42, 24, 32, 0.16);
        background: var(--card-raised);
